  "sections": [
    {
      "sectionId": "section-introduction",
      "heading": "Introduction",
      "sourceAnchor": "introduction",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "blockId": "block-section-introduction-1",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "\n\tThe Spellfire Adept feat leans hard into spells which deal Radiant damage,\n\tallowing you to convert your own Hit Point Dice into additional spell damage\n\tand allowing you to bypass resistance to Radiant damage. If you’re built to\n\tlean heavily on Radiant damage, it’s a great feat. Otherwise, you’ll find\n\tlittle value here.\n"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "blockId": "block-section-introduction-2",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Spellfire Adept requires the "
            },
            {
              "type": "link",
              "text": "Spellfire Spark",
              "href": "https://rpgbot.net/2024-dnd/feats/spellfire-spark/"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": " feat."
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "sectionId": "section-ability-score-increase",
      "heading": "Ability Score Increase",
      "sourceAnchor": "ability-score-increase",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "blockId": "block-section-ability-score-increase-1",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Any mental stat. Easy for casters."
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "sectionId": "section-fueled-spellfire",
      "heading": "Fueled Spellfire",
      "sourceAnchor": "fueled-spellfire",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "blockId": "block-section-fueled-spellfire-1",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "\n\tIf you have good multi-target radiant damage spells, this is absolutely worth\n\tthe cost. I would rarely bother adding this to single-target spells, though.\n\tNote that this only applies to a single damage roll of the spell, so you can’t\n\tuse this multiple times with spells like Spirit Guardians.\n"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "sectionId": "section-searing-spellfire",
      "heading": "Searing Spellfire",
      "sourceAnchor": "searing-spellfire",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "blockId": "block-section-searing-spellfire-1",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "\n\tResistance to Radiant damage is extremely rare. Radiant damage is typically\n\tused to bypass damage resistances to more common damage types like Fire\n\tdamage.\n"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
